[{"id":"CN-NET-006","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["课程路线","依赖"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(一)入门路线.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(一)入门路线","articlePath":"posts/347ce4f2/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(一)入门路线.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(一)入门路线","articlePath":"posts/347ce4f2/"}],"articleIndex":6,"articleCount":7,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么课程按局域网 → IP → UDP/TCP → HTTP → 现代 HTTP → 排障推进？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>后一个主题依赖前一个主题的地址、下一跳、传输状态和应用语义，按依赖顺序才能把抽象现象还原为可观察证据。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>进阶路线和综合实战放在主线之后；它们复用前置闪卡，不用更多名词替代基础机制。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"playwright-advanced-quality-gate","type":"choice","priority":2,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["无障碍","质量门"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(十一)进阶路线.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(十一)进阶路线","articlePath":"posts/4504d456/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(十一)进阶路线.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(十一)进阶路线","articlePath":"posts/4504d456/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>required 的键盘检查被跳过、optional 的视觉检查失败时，质量门应如何判定？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>C\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>SKIPPED 不能冒充绿色；optional 失败也应记录和评估，但阻断原因首先来自 required 键盘检查未完成。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":["C"],"options":[{"key":"A","labelHtml":"\u003cp>通过，因为视觉是 optional\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"B","labelHtml":"\u003cp>自动把键盘检查改为不适用\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"C","labelHtml":"\u003cp>阻断，因为 required 信号不是 PASS 或 NOT_APPLICABLE\u003c/p>\n"}]}]